WEBVTT

00:10:29.738 --> 00:10:31.936
to wield it for the betterment of mankind

00:10:31.960 --> 00:10:33.111
or not.

00:10:33.135 --> 00:10:35.358
And so I urge you all
to wake up and to tune in

00:10:35.382 --> 00:10:38.778
and to influence the genomic revolution
that's happening all around you.

00:10:38.802 --> 00:10:39.953
Thank you.

00:10:39.977 --> 00:10:42.420
(Applause)